\'b5 v\'cbn \'ae\'e9ng v\'b5 t\'e6 ch\'f8c s\'f9 tham gia r\'e9ng r\'b7i c\'f1a nh\'a9n d\'a9n, c\'f1a to\'b5n x\'b7 h\'e9i v\'b5o s\'f9 ph\'b8t tri\'d3n c\'b8c s\'f9 nghi\'d6p \'ae\'e3 nh\'bbm t\'f5ng b\'ad\'edc n\'a9ng cao m\'f8c h\'ad\'ebng th\'f4 v
\'d2 gi\'b8o d\'f4c, y t\'d5, v\'a8n ho\'b8, th\'d3 thao trong s\'f9 ph\'b8t tri\'d3n v\'d2 v\'cbt ch\'cat v\'b5 tinh th\'c7n c\'f1a nh\'a9n d\'a9n.
\par }{\b\fs28\cf0\insrsid9532946 \tab 
\par \'a7i\'d2u 2. }{\fs28\cf0\insrsid9532946 C\'efng v\'edi vi\'d6c c\'f1ng c\'e8 c\'b8c t\'e6 ch\'f8c c\'abng l\'cbp, Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc khuy\'d5n kh\'ddch ph\'b8t tri\'d3n r\'e9ng r\'b7i c\'b8c c\'ac s\'eb ngo\'b5i c\'abng l\'cbp ph\'ef h\'eep v\'edi quy ho
\'b9ch c\'f1a Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc trong c\'b8c l\'dcnh v\'f9c gi\'b8o d\'f4c, y t\'d5, v\'a8n ho\'b8, th\'d3 thao, ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng kh\'abng theo m\'f4c \'ae\'ddch th\'ad\'acng m\'b9i ho\'b8 (d\'ad\'edi \'ae\'a9y g\'e4i l\'b5 c\'ac s\'eb ngo\'b5i c\'ab
ng l\'cbp). 
\par 
\par }\pard\plain \s19\qj \fi547\li0\ri0\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f38\fs28\lang2057\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp1033 {\insrsid9532946 Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc v\'b5 x\'b7 h\'e9i coi tr\'e4ng v\'b5 \'ae\'e8i x\'f6 b\'d7nh 
\'ae\'bcng \'ae\'e8i v\'edi c\'b8c s\'b6n ph\'c8m v\'b5 d\'dech v\'f4 c\'f1a c\'ac s\'eb ngo\'b5i c\'abng l\'cbp nh\'ad c\'b8c s\'b6n ph\'c8m v\'b5 d\'dech v\'f4 c\'f1a c\'ac s\'eb c\'abng l\'cbp. C\'b8c c\'ac s\'eb ngo\'b5i c\'abng l\'cbp c\'f2ng c\'e3 m
\'e9t ph\'c7n tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m thu nh\'cbn v\'b5 cung c\'cap d\'dech v\'f4 cho c\'b8c \'ae\'e8i t\'ad\'eeng ch\'ddnh s\'b8ch x\'b7 h\'e9i nh\'ad c\'b8c c\'ac s\'eb c\'abng l\'cbp.
\par }\pard\plain \qj \fi547\li0\ri0\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f38\fs26\cf9\lang2057\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp1033 {\b\fs28\cf0\insrsid9532946 
\par \'a7i\'d2u 3.}{\fs28\cf0\insrsid9532946 \tab Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc khuy\'d5n kh\'ddch c\'b8c t\'e6 ch\'f8c v\'b5 c\'b8 nh\'a9n huy \'ae\'e9ng c\'b8c ngu\'e5n l\'f9c trong nh\'a9n d\'a9n v\'b5 trong c\'b8c t\'e6 ch\'f8c thu\'e9c m\'e4i th\'b5nh ph\'c7n kinh t
\'d5 \'ae\'d3 ph\'b8t tri\'d3n c\'b8c ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng gi\'b8o d\'f4c, y t\'d5, v\'a8n ho\'b8, th\'d3 thao theo \'ae\'f3ng quy \'ae\'denh c\'f1a ph\'b8p lu\'cbt.
\par }{\b\fs28\cf0\insrsid9532946 
\par \'a7i\'d2u 4. }{\fs28\cf0\insrsid9532946 C\'b8c h\'d7nh th\'f8c ngo\'b5i c\'abng l\'cbp :
\par 
\par 1. B\'b8n c\'abng : L\'b5 c\'ac s\'eb \'ae\'ad\'eec th\'b5nh l\'cbp tr\'aan c\'ac s\'eb li\'aan k\'d5t gi\'f7a t\'e6 ch\'f8c Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc v\'edi c\'b8c t\'e6 ch\'f8c kh\'abng ph\'b6i t\'e6 ch\'f8c Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc, thu\'e9c m\'e4i th\'b5nh ph\'c7
n kinh t\'d5 ho\'c6c c\'b8c c\'b8 nh\'a9n theo c\'b8c ph\'ad\'acng th\'f8c : th\'b5nh l\'cbp m\'edi, chuy\'d3n to\'b5n b\'e9 ho\'c6c m\'e9t ph\'c7n t\'f5 \'ae\'acn v\'de c\'abng l\'cbp \'ae\'d3 c\'efng \'ae\'c7u t\'ad x\'a9y d\'f9ng c\'ac s\'eb v\'cbt ch
\'cat, qu\'b6n l\'fd, \'aei\'d2u h\'b5nh m\'e4i ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng theo quy \'ae\'denh cu\'b6 ph\'b8p lu\'cbt. 
\par 
\par 2. D\'a9n l\'cbp : L\'b5 c\'ac s\'eb do t\'e6 ch\'f8c \'ae\'f8ng ra th\'b5nh l\'cbp, \'ae\'ad\'eec \'ae\'c7u t\'ad b\'bbng v\'e8n ngo\'b5i ng\'a9n s\'b8ch nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc (v\'e8n c\'f1a t\'e6 ch\'f8c, t\'cbp th\'d3, c\'b8 nh\'a9n) v\'b5 qu\'b6n l\'fd 
\'aei\'d2u h\'b5nh m\'e4i ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng theo quy \'ae\'denh c\'f1a ph\'b8p lu\'cbt. Kh\'abng l\'cay v\'e8n, t\'b5i s\'b6n, kinh ph\'dd c\'f1a Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc \'ae\'d3 \'ae\'c7u t\'ad cho c\'b8c c\'ac s\'eb d\'a9n l\'cbp. 
\par 
\par 3. T\'ad nh\'a9n : L\'b5 c\'ac s\'eb do c\'b8 nh\'a9n, h\'e9 gia \'ae\'d7nh th\'b5nh l\'cbp v\'b5 qu\'b6n l\'fd \'aei\'d2u h\'b5nh m\'e4i ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng theo quy \'ae\'denh c\'f1a ph\'b8p lu\'cbt. 
\par 
\par B\'e9 tr\'ad\'ebng c\'b8c B\'e9 : Gi\'b8o d\'f4c v\'b5 \'a7\'b5o t\'b9o, Lao \'ae\'e9ng - Th\'ad\'acng binh v\'b5 X\'b7 h\'e9i, }{\f37\fs28\cf0\insrsid9532946 y}{\fs28\cf0\insrsid9532946  t\'d5, V\'a8n h\'e3a - Th\'abng tin, B\'e9 tr\'ad\'ebng, Ch\'f1 nhi
\'d6m }{\f37\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\insrsid9532946 \'f1}{\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033\insrsid9532946 y ban}{\fs28\cf0\insrsid9532946  Th\'d3 d\'f4c Th\'d3 thao ph\'e8i h\'eep v\'edi c\'b8c B\'e9, ng\'b5nh h\'f7u quan, c\'a8n c
\'f8 v\'b5o Ngh\'de quy\'d5t s\'e8 90/CP ng\'b5y 21 th\'b8ng 8 n\'a8m 1997 c\'f1a Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 v\'d2 ph\'ad\'acng h\'ad\'edng v\'b5 ch\'f1 tr\'ad\'acng x\'b7 h\'e9i h\'e3a c\'b8c ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng gi\'b8o d\'f4c, y t\'d5, v\'a8n h\'e3a v\'b5 Ngh\'de 
\'ae\'denh n\'b5y \'ae\'d3 x\'a9y d\'f9ng quy ho\'b9ch ph\'b8t tri\'d3n c\'b8c h\'d7nh th\'f8c ngo\'b5i c\'abng l\'cbp thu\'e9c ng\'b5nh m\'d7nh, c\'f4 th\'d3 h\'e3a c\'b8c ch\'f1 tr\'ad\'acng v\'b5 m\'f8c \'ae\'e9 \'adu ti\'aan, khuy\'d5n kh\'ddch ph\'b8
t tri\'d3n c\'b8c h\'d7nh th\'f8c ngo\'b5i c\'abng l\'cbp ph\'ef h\'eep v\'edi t\'f5ng l\'dcnh v\'f9c, t\'f5ng lo\'b9i h\'d7nh ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng.
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\sl-360\slmult1\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\fs28\cf0\insrsid9532946 
