\'ad\'acng \'ae\'d3 giao \'ae\'cat ho\'c6c cho c\'ac s\'eb ngo\'b5i c\'abng l\'cbp \'ae\'ad\'eec thu\'aa \'ae\'cat l\'b5m c\'ac s\'eb ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng. C\'b8c c\'ac s\'eb ngo\'b5i c\'abng l\'cbp ph\'b6i s\'f6 d\'f4ng \'ae\'cat \'ae\'ad\'eec giao, \'ae
\'ad\'eec thu\'aa \'ae\'f3ng m\'f4c \'ae\'ddch v\'b5 ch\'cap h\'b5nh \'ae\'f3ng c\'b8c quy \'ae\'denh c\'f1a ph\'b8p lu\'cbt v\'d2 \'ae\'cat \'aeai. M\'e4i tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep s\'f6 d\'f4ng \'ae\'cat kh\'abng \'ae\'f3ng m\'f4c \'ae\'ddch khi giao \'ae\'ca
t, ph\'b6i b\'de thu h\'e5i theo quy \'ae\'denh c\'f1a ph\'b8p lu\'cbt. 
